      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LAKODA FOCUS (1) comes off an average performance last start when sixth at this track over 457m behind Jack's Doubled (26.05) in a Grade 5. Goes well out of this box with a win and four minor placings. Should be very hard to beat this time. SHANDY'S BIRDIE (8) is progressing well with another good run, placing by 0.8 lengths (23.89) in a Grade 5 at Casino. Still to record a win from this draw but has never missed the frame in two starts. Can measure up. LOLA EXPRESS (2) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing sixth (20.40) in a Grade 5 at this track. Key runner who gets her chance to atone. ROCKET ROXY (5) scored in dominant fashion last time. Must be respected.",
